{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2022-09-28 00:00:00', 'title': 'GLOBAL BUSINESS LEADERS SAY HYBRID CLOUD IS CRITICAL TO MODERNIZATION, YET SECURITY, SKILLS AND COMPLIANCE CONCERNS IMPEDE SUCCESS', 'text': 'NEW IBM TRANSFORMATION INDEX: STATE OF CLOUD HELPS BUSINESS LEADERS TO ASSESS GAPS IN THEIR TRANSFORMATION JOURNEY MORE THAN HALF OF RESPONDENTS ARE CURRENTLY CONCERNED ABOUT SECURITY, WHILE 53% BELIEVE ENSURING COMPLIANCE IN THE CLOUD IS CURRENTLY TOO DIFFICULT NEARLY 70% SURVEYED SAY THEIR TEAM LACKS THE SKILLS NEEDED TO SUFFICIENTLY MANAGE CLOUD ENVIRONMENTS ARMONK, N.Y. , SEPT. 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NEW GLOBAL MARKET RESEARCH FROM IBM (NYSE: IBM ) REVEALED THAT MORE THAN 77% OF RESPONDENTS HAVE ADOPTED A HYBRID CLOUD APPROACH WHICH CAN HELP DRIVE DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION, YET THE MAJORITY OF RESPONDING ORGANIZATIONS ARE STRUGGLING WITH THE COMPLEXITY TO MAKE ALL THEIR CLOUD ENVIRONMENTS WORK TOGETHER.'}